<tr>
<td><p class="texttitle">Welcome to "Together as One's" Website!</p>
Welcome to our new Website Portal! This portal is being built to allow everyone easy access to T-A-O information as well as information on all aspects of the game Everquest.<br><br>If you have any ideas please let me know! I am all for it!<br>Kimbaa - Guild Leader TaO<br><CENTER><img src="http://www.t-a-o.net/images/vs.jpg"></CENTER><br>Here is the hideous Venril Sathir.  TaO as well as members of N.A.T.O. rampaged through his Castle several moons ago. He was able to push us back into retreat.  We will return and be better prepared next time.<br>
<br><br></td>
</tr>
